OL,3,GNEWSA'Exciting' #7.5m museum revamp
OL,4,Agiven green light
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn Rutland County Museum
OL,7,Finto a "first-class visitor attraction"
OL,8,Fhave been given the green light.
OL,10,FThe #7.5m renovation of the Grade II
OL,11,Flisted-museum, in Catmos Street,
OL,12,FOakham, will include a new extension to
OL,13,Fhouse a multi-purpose hall, cafe, shop
OL,14,Fand new galleries.
OL,16,FThe project will also include digital
OL,17,Finterpretations of the Rutland Sea
OL,18,FDragon - which was unearthed in 2021 -
OL,19,Fand the Ketton Roman Mosaic, discovered
OL,20,Fin 2020.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
