OL,3,GNEWSA'Exciting' #7.5m museum revamp
OL,4,Agiven green light
OL,5,
OL,6,FRutland County Council said the
OL,7,Fredevelopment, which was approved by
OL,8,Fits planning committee on Tuesday, was
OL,9,F"exciting" and designed to secure the
OL,10,Fmuseum's long-term future.
